  "description": "*“Let the monster devour you.”*\n\nAt the shaman’s shrine he visited to lift a mysterious curse, Hae-Gang meets Yeon-Ho, a fox spirit who will devour the monster dwelling within him. Yeon-Ho, who needs spiritual energy to become a gumiho, agrees to take Hae-Gang’s vital energy in exchange for protecting him from the serpent’s curse…\n\n *“Now, it’s time to eat.”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
